oked' happens on a schedule because the OAuth app is in Testing mode; publishing the app to production removes the 7-day expiry."}, {"id": "setup_serviceaccountrationale", "label": "Service account chosen for zero-maintenance auth + enabling in-dashboard Refresh", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "SETUP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A service account never expires and needs no browser, so it makes the in-dashboard Refresh button work \u2014 that runs scripts server-side where a login flow can't open a browser."}, {"id": "setup_timedoffersnapshotworkflow", "label": "Timed Offers snapshot-over-window workflow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "SETUP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "setup_vercelstaticdeployment", "label": "Vercel static deployment (serves committed HTML, no build step)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "SETUP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "vercel.json only sets the home-page rewrite; the deployed site equals whatever HTML was last committed, so updating hosted data requires running main.py or build_all.py locally then committing & pushing."}, {"id": "setup_vercelconfigjson", "label": "vercel.json", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "SETUP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "setup_buildallpy", "label": "build_all.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "SETUP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "setup_gitignoresecretsrule", "label": "Secrets excluded via .gitignore / .vercelignore", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "SETUP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author